    "why": [
      "The Gold Account earns 5.5% APY.",
      "Your $5,000 balance meets the reduced $5,000 minimum required when you hold a Gold Rewards Card.",
      "The Gold Rewards Card has a $0 annual fee and adds a 0.025% APY bonus to the Gold Account.",
      "The Gold Account's usual $10 monthly maintenance fee should be avoided as long as you maintain the required $5,000 balance and keep the Gold Rewards Card active.",
